#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/neural-training-basics.md:2
msgid "训练基础：登山纪律"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/neural-training-basics.md:4
msgid "登山纪律——装备好也会摔，监控损失曲线，控制学习率。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/neural-training-basics.md:6
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"行囊备好。但登山者的第一条铁律：**先学纪律，再学攀登。** "
"纪律是什么？监控损失曲线——知道模型在变好还是变坏；选对学习率——步子太大摔跤，太小爬不动；知道什么时候停——练过头就是死记硬背。这些比架构本身更能决定一次攀登的成败。{doc"
"}`fc-layer-basics` 和 {doc}`cnn-basics` "
"教会了你搭架构——但知道\"建什么\"不等于知道\"怎么训练\"。本节从 {ref}`gradient-descent` 和 {ref"
"}`back-propagation` 的理论出发，掌握让神经网络真正\"学会\"的实战技巧。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/neural-training-basics.md:8
msgid "训练的本质：从数据到能力"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/neural-training-basics.md:10
msgid "想象你在教小孩认数字。你不会只给他看一遍卡片就指望他记住，而是需要："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/neural-training-basics.md:12
msgid "**反复练习**：同一组卡片看很多遍（多轮训练）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/neural-training-basics.md:13
msgid "**及时反馈**：猜对了表扬，猜错了纠正（计算损失）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/neural-training-basics.md:14
msgid "**循序渐进**：从简单到复杂，调整学习节奏（学习率调度）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/neural-training-basics.md:15
msgid "**防止死记**：确保他理解数字的本质，不只是记住卡片（防止过拟合）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/neural-training-basics.md:17
#, python-brace-format
msgid "神经网络训练完全遵循同样的逻辑。{ref}`gradient-descent`告诉我们沿着梯度方向更新参数，但实践中还有大量细节需要把握。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/neural-training-basics.md:21
msgid "核心训练概念"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/neural-training-basics.md:23
msgid "在深入之前，我们需要统一几个基本概念："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/neural-training-basics.md:25
msgid "**Epoch（轮次）**：完整遍历整个训练数据集一次。就像把整副卡片从头到尾看一遍。MNIST有60,000张训练图片，一个epoch就是看完全部60,000张。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/neural-training-basics.md:27
msgid ""
"**Batch（批次）**：一次更新参数时使用的样本集合。如果一次看一张就更新，效率太低；如果看完60,000张才更新，内存可能不够。**Batch"
" Size**就是每批的样本数，常用32、64、128等2的幂次。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/neural-training-basics.md:29
msgid "**Iteration（迭代）**：完成一个批次的训练。一个epoch包含的迭代次数 = 总样本数 ÷ Batch Size。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/neural-training-basics.md:31
msgid "MNIST训练示例"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/neural-training-basics.md:34
msgid "总训练样本：60,000张"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/neural-training-basics.md:35
msgid "Batch Size：64"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/neural-training-basics.md:36
msgid "每epoch的迭代次数：60,000 ÷ 64 ≈ 938次"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/neural-training-basics.md:37
msgid "训练10个epoch：总共迭代9,380次，更新参数9,380次"
msgstr ""

