#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/neural-training-basics.md:52
msgid "MNIST的交叉熵"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/neural-training-basics.md:55
msgid "MNIST是10类分类，使用**交叉熵损失**："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/neural-training-basics.md:57
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\mathcal{L} = -\\sum_{c=1}^{10} y_c \\log(p_c)\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/neural-training-basics.md:61
msgid "$y_c$：真实标签的one-hot编码（目标类别为1，其余为0）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/neural-training-basics.md:62
msgid "$p_c$：Softmax输出的概率"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/neural-training-basics.md:64
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**为什么不用MSE？** 分类任务的输出是概率分布，交叉熵对这种\"分布间的差异\"更敏感，且避免了梯度消失问题（见{ref}`back-"
"propagation`）。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/neural-training-basics.md:69
msgid "过拟合与欠拟合：学习的两种失败"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/neural-training-basics.md:71
msgid "训练神经网络就像准备考试——有两种典型的失败模式："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/neural-training-basics.md:73
msgid "欠拟合：学得太少"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/neural-training-basics.md:75
msgid "想象一个学生只翻了翻课本，没做练习题就去考试："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/neural-training-basics.md:77
msgid "训练时表现就不好（训练损失高）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/neural-training-basics.md:78
msgid "考试时更差（验证损失也高）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/neural-training-basics.md:79
msgid "**原因**：模型太简单，没能捕捉数据的基本规律"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/neural-training-basics.md:80
msgid "**解决**：增加网络深度、训练更长时间、降低正则化强度"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/neural-training-basics.md:82
msgid "过拟合：死记硬背"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/neural-training-basics.md:84
msgid "另一个学生把所有练习题都背下来了："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/neural-training-basics.md:86
msgid "做练习题时几乎全对（训练损失很低）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/neural-training-basics.md:87
msgid "遇到新题就不会（验证损失高，差距大）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/neural-training-basics.md:88
msgid "**原因**：模型记住了训练数据的噪声，而非学习通用规律"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/neural-training-basics.md:89
msgid "**解决**：使用正则化、早停、数据增强、降低模型复杂度"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/neural-training-basics.md:92
msgid "模型复杂度与泛化性能"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/neural-training-basics.md:119
msgid "图中的\"最佳点\"是我们追求的目标：足够复杂的模型捕捉规律，但不至于过拟合。找到这个点需要**验证集**——用训练集学习，用验证集调参，最后用测试集评估。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/neural-training-basics.md:123
msgid "数据划分：训练集、验证集、测试集"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/neural-training-basics.md:125
msgid "为什么需要三组数据？"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/neural-training-basics.md:127
msgid "**训练集**：学习参数（权重和偏置）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/neural-training-basics.md:128
msgid "**验证集**：选择超参数（学习率、网络结构、正则化强度）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/neural-training-basics.md:129
msgid "**测试集**：最终评估（只能用一次！）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/neural-training-basics.md:131
msgid "测试集的禁忌"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/neural-training-basics.md:134
msgid "测试集只能用于最终报告，绝不能用来调参或选择模型。否则就像考试时偷看答案——分数虚高，真实能力被高估。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/neural-training-basics.md:137
msgid ""
"MNIST的标准划分：60,000训练 + "
"10,000测试。实践中，我们会从训练集中分出10%（6,000张）作为验证集，剩下54,000张真正用于训练。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/neural-training-basics.md:142
msgid "正则化：防止死记硬背的四种方法"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/neural-training-basics.md:144
msgid "正则化的核心思想：**限制模型的\"记忆能力\"，逼迫它学习\"理解能力\"**。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/neural-training-basics.md:146
msgid "为什么需要限制？想象一个拥有超强记忆力的学生——他可以背下所有练习题答案，考试时遇到原题全对，但稍微变化就不会。神经网络也有这种\"过强记忆\"的能力，特别是参数量大时。正则化就是防止这种\"死记硬背\"。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/neural-training-basics.md:150
msgid "1. L2正则化（权重衰减）：强制\"粗笔画\""
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/neural-training-basics.md:152
msgid "核心洞察：权重大小决定决策边界的\"粗细\""
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/neural-training-basics.md:155
msgid "想象用画笔画画："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/neural-training-basics.md:156
msgid "**细笔画**（大权重）：可以画出非常锐利、复杂的边界，精确勾勒每个训练样本的细节——就像用0.5mm的针管笔，能画出极细的线条"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/neural-training-basics.md:157
msgid "**粗笔画**（小权重）：只能画出平滑、模糊的轮廓，捕捉大体形状——就像用毛笔，线条自然柔和"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/neural-training-basics.md:159
msgid "神经网络的决策边界也是由权重决定的。大权重让边界变得\"尖锐\"，可以\"钻牛角尖\"去拟合每个训练点；小权重让边界保持\"平滑\"，只能学习通用的模式。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/neural-training-basics.md:162
msgid "为什么L2惩罚能实现这一点？"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/neural-training-basics.md:164
msgid "L2正则化在损失函数中加入权重的平方和："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/neural-training-basics.md:166
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\mathcal{L}_{\\text{total}} = \\mathcal{L}_{\\text{original}} + "
"\\frac{\\lambda}{2} \\sum_{i} w_i^2\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/neural-training-basics.md:170
msgid "**关键洞察**：平方惩罚对大权重的\"惩罚力度\"远大于小权重。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/neural-training-basics.md:152
msgid "权重值"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/neural-training-basics.md:152
msgid "原始损失惩罚"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/neural-training-basics.md:152
msgid "平方惩罚"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/neural-training-basics.md:152
msgid "相对增加"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/neural-training-basics.md:152
msgid "0.1"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/neural-training-basics.md:152
msgid "1"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/neural-training-basics.md:152
msgid "0.01"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/neural-training-basics.md:152
msgid "1%"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/neural-training-basics.md:152
msgid "1.0"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/neural-training-basics.md:152
msgid "0.5"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/neural-training-basics.md:152
msgid "50%"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/neural-training-basics.md:152
msgid "10.0"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/neural-training-basics.md:152
msgid "50"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/neural-training-basics.md:152
msgid "5000%"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/neural-training-basics.md:178
msgid "**结果**：优化器会发现，与其让少数权重变得很大（承担巨额平方惩罚），不如让所有权重都保持较小。这就像税收——平方税率对大收入者更严厉，促使财富分布更均匀。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/neural-training-basics.md:180
msgid ""
"# PyTorch中的L2正则化（weight_decay）\n"
"optimizer = torch.optim.Adam(\n"
"    model.parameters(),\n"
"    lr=0.001,\n"
"    weight_decay=1e-4  # λ = 0.0001\n"
")\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/neural-training-basics.md:189
msgid ""
"**为什么有效？** "
"小权重的网络更\"保守\"，不会为了拟合某个训练样本的噪声而剧烈调整输出。它必须找到更通用的规律，才能在保持权重小的同时降低原始损失。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/neural-training-basics.md:193
msgid "2. Dropout：随机\"罢工\"迫使协作"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/neural-training-basics.md:195
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Dropout 由 Srivastava 等人在 2014 年提出 "
"{cite}`srivastava2014dropout`，是防止神经网络过拟合的有效方法。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/neural-training-basics.md:197
msgid "核心洞察：随机\"点名\"防止依赖\"学霸\""
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/neural-training-basics.md:200
msgid "想象一个班级有50人，老师提问时总是叫同一个\"学霸\"回答："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/neural-training-basics.md:201
msgid "学霸越来越厉害（某些神经元权重变得极大）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/neural-training-basics.md:202
msgid "其他同学从不思考（其他神经元权重趋于0）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/neural-training-basics.md:203
msgid "结果：班级极度依赖学霸，一旦学霸生病（过拟合到新数据），全班表现崩盘"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/neural-training-basics.md:205
msgid "Dropout就像**随机点名**：每次提问随机抽一半同学，学霸也可能被抽中休息。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/neural-training-basics.md:206
msgid "**后果**：每个人都必须准备好回答问题"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/neural-training-basics.md:207
msgid "**结果**：知识必须在全班**分布式存储**，形成**冗余表示**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/neural-training-basics.md:210
msgid "为什么冗余表示能防止过拟合？"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/neural-training-basics.md:212
msgid "过拟合的本质是\"记忆\"——模型记住了训练数据的具体特征（包括噪声）。如果知识只存储在少数几个神经元中，这些神经元就会\"死记硬背\"训练样本。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/neural-training-basics.md:214
msgid "Dropout 迫使知识分散存储："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/neural-training-basics.md:216
msgid "识别\"横线\"的特征不是由某1个神经元专门负责，而是由10个神经元共同分担"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/neural-training-basics.md:217
msgid "即使其中5个被\"dropout\"了，剩下5个还能大致识别横线"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/neural-training-basics.md:218
msgid "每个神经元都不能\"偷懒\"记忆特定样本，必须学习通用特征"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/neural-training-basics.md:220
msgid ""
"class Net(nn.Module):\n"
"    def __init__(self):\n"
"        super().__init__()\n"
"        self.fc1 = nn.Linear(784, 256)\n"
"        self.dropout = nn.Dropout(0.5)  # 50%的dropout\n"
"        self.fc2 = nn.Linear(256, 10)\n"
"        \n"
"    def forward(self, x):\n"
"        x = F.relu(self.fc1(x))\n"
"        x = self.dropout(x)  # 训练时随机丢弃，测试时自动关闭\n"
"        return self.fc2(x)\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/neural-training-basics.md:234
msgid ""
"**测试时为什么关闭Dropout？** 训练时的随机丢弃相当于训练了多个\"子网络\"（2^N种可能的组合）。测试时我们使用完整网络，相当于 "
"**集成（ensemble）** 了所有这些子网络的预测，取平均——这通常比任何单个子网络更稳定。"
msgstr ""

